@startuml
title 分析状态机图（四）— 任务阶段（美编设计实例）
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F5FAFF
skinparam classBorderColor #46637F
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 45
hide empty description
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #F5FAFF
skinparam stateBorderColor #46637F

state "待前序" as Waiting
state "可派发" as Ready
state "待完成" as Working
state "待完成确认" as Confirm
state "待修改" as Returned
state "已完成" as Done
[*] --> Waiting
Waiting --> Ready : 检查可开始()\n[无前序或前序已完成]
Ready --> Working : 派发()\n[本部门部长有权且承接人有效]\n/ 确立承接关系
Working --> Confirm : 提交成果()\n[当前承接人且设计成果完整]\n/ 保存成果及贡献依据
Confirm --> Returned : 确认完成()\n[本部门部长退回且意见完整]\n/ 保存修改要求
Returned --> Confirm : 提交成果()\n[当前承接人且修订完整]\n/ 保留历次成果
Confirm --> Done : 确认完成()\n[本部门部长通过且成果齐备]\n/ 确认贡献依据
Done : 确认完成()\n[重复合法请求]\n/ 返回原结果
note bottom of Done
  本图限定为不涉及稿件内容审核的设计阶段。
  已完成阶段保留查询能力；计量由任务整体组织。
end note

@enduml
